        "message.0444eae0ac": ["en": ["other": "Use 1–80 characters without control characters (up to 512 UTF-8 bytes)."], "ru": ["other": "Используйте 1–80 символов без управляющих знаков (до 512 байт UTF-8)."], "uz-Latn": ["other": "Boshqaruv belgilarisiz 1–80 ta belgi kiriting (512 bayt UTF-8 gacha)."]],
        "message.05a64cfe86": ["en": ["other": "The environment is missing. No directory was recreated and no sign-in was started."], "ru": ["other": "Окружение отсутствует. Каталоги не создавались, вход не начинался."], "uz-Latn": ["other": "Muhit yo‘q. Papkalar qayta yaratilmadi, kirish boshlanmadi."]],
